Ossain is a 5'6" skeleton, with deep red glowing points of light for eyes and a jaw broken in three places. He serves as the majordomo of [[Nos Mortem]].

When the Party came to the manor he took them for the guests Master Grayson had said would arrive, led them to a lounge, and left them with a bell for the footman.
